---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Transparency & Legal | Rex Autistikōn Labs"
  description="Tax-exempt status, determination letter, and organizational transparency for Rex Autistikon Research Foundation, Inc."
>
  <section class="py-16">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-bold text-slate-900 mb-4">Transparency &amp; Legal</h1>
      <p class="text-lg text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mb-10">
        Rex Autistikon Research Foundation, Inc. is committed to clear public disclosure of its
        tax-exempt status and organizational identity.
      </p>

      <!-- 501(c)(3) status -->
      <div class="bg-teal-50 border border-teal-100 rounded-xl p-8 mb-10">
        <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-slate-900 mb-3">501(c)(3) Public Charity</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-700 leading-relaxed mb-4">
          Rex Autistikon Research Foundation, Inc. is exempt from federal income tax under
          Internal Revenue Code Section <strong>501(c)(3)</strong>. We are classified as a{' '}
          <strong>public charity under IRC Section 509(a)(2)</strong>.
        </p>
        <dl class="grid sm:grid-cols-2 gap-3 text-sm text-slate-700 mb-6">
          <div>
            <dt class="font-semibold text-slate-900">Legal name</dt>
            <dd>Rex Autistikon Research Foundation, Inc.</dd>
          </div>
          <div>
            <dt class="font-semibold text-slate-900">EIN</dt>
            <dd>42-3220323</dd>
          </div>
          <div>
            <dt class="font-semibold text-slate-900">Effective date of exemption</dt>
            <dd>June 17, 2026</dd>
          </div>
          <div>
            <dt class="font-semibold text-slate-900">Contribution deductibility</dt>
            <dd>Yes (IRC §170)</dd>
          </div>
          <div>
            <dt class="font-semibold text-slate-900">Accounting period</dt>
            <dd>December 31</dd>
          </div>
          <div>
            <dt class="font-semibold text-slate-900">Form 990 series</dt>
            <dd>Required</dd>
          </div>
        </dl>
        <p class="text-slate-700 leading-relaxed mb-6">
          Donors may deduct contributions under IRC Section 170. The organization is also
          qualified to receive tax-deductible bequests, devises, transfers, or gifts under
          Sections 2055, 2106, or 2522.
        </p>
        <a
          href="/501c3-determination-letter.pdf"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="inline-flex items-center px-6 py-3 bg-teal-700 text-white font-medium rounded-lg hover:bg-teal-800 transition-colors"
        >
          View IRS Determination Letter (PDF) →
        </a>
      </div>

      <!-- Address -->
      <div class="border border-slate-200 rounded-xl p-6 mb-10 bg-white">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-slate-900 mb-3">Registered address</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed">
          Rex Autistikon Research Foundation, Inc.<br />
          1485 Fouraker Rd #2402<br />
          Jacksonville, FL 32221<br />
          United States
        </p>
        <p class="text-slate-600 mt-4">
          <a href="mailto:info@rexautistikonlabs.org" data-analytics-event="contact_email_click" class="text-teal-700 font-medium hover:text-teal-800">
            info@rexautistikonlabs.org
          </a>
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- TEOS / public lookup -->
      <div class="border border-slate-200 rounded-xl p-6 mb-10 bg-white">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-slate-900 mb-3">Public verification</h2>
        <p class="text-slate-600 leading-relaxed mb-4">
          Once the organization appears in the IRS Tax Exempt Organization Search (TEOS),
          the public listing can be used as an independent verification of exempt status.
        </p>
        <a
          href="https://apps.irs.gov/app/eos/"
          target="_blank"
          rel="noopener noreferrer"
          class="text-teal-700 font-medium hover:text-teal-800"
        >
          IRS Tax Exempt Organization Search →
        </a>
        <p class="text-sm text-slate-500 mt-3">
          Search by EIN <strong>42-3220323</strong> or legal name{' '}
          <strong>Rex Autistikon Research Foundation</strong>. New determinations may take
          several weeks to appear in TEOS after the letter date.
        </p>
      </div>

      <!-- Related -->
      <div class="border border-slate-200 rounded-xl p-6 bg-slate-50">
        <h2 class="text-lg font-semibold text-slate-900 mb-3">Related pages</h2>
        <ul class="space-y-2 text-slate-600">
          <li>
            <a href="/about" class="text-teal-700 font-medium hover:text-teal-800">About the Foundation</a>
            — legal identity and mission
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="/privacy" class="text-teal-700 font-medium hover:text-teal-800">Privacy Policy</a>
            — what we collect and how to request access or correction
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="/support" class="text-teal-700 font-medium hover:text-teal-800">Support the Research</a>
            — tax-deductible contributions
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="/irb-faq" class="text-teal-700 font-medium hover:text-teal-800">IRB &amp; Ethics FAQ</a>
            — data handling for institutional review
          </li>
          <li>
            <a href="/how-to-collaborate" class="text-teal-700 font-medium hover:text-teal-800">How to Collaborate</a>
            — research partner access process
          </li>
        </ul>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
